            // facet deepThenArmHoistDrain (PR #333): the deep-then `thenArg` sibling of the #276
            // BigInteger pull — a `final Mapper*<X> <sentinel> = …;` decl the arm compile
            // registered (CollectionHandler.tryDeepThenHoist's sink path) whose sentinel the
            // arm value REFERENCES emits INSIDE the owning branch (golden order — the jfsa
            // NotionalAmountLeg1/2 min-hoist + the PriorUti* thenArg1..5 else-chains). Pre-#333
            // the re-register fall-through left the decl on the sink where NOTHING drains
